# Run "Create a city" in cities.http first; it sets {{cityId}}.

### Create a theater
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/theaters
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"cityId": {{cityId}}, "name": "PVR Forum", "area": "Koramangala", "address": "Hosur Road"}

> {% client.global.set("theaterId", response.body.id); %}

### Add a screen
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/theaters/{{theaterId}}/screens
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"name": "Audi 1"}

> {% client.global.set("screenId", response.body.id); %}

### Rename the screen
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/screens/{{screenId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"name": "Audi 1 (IMAX)"}

### Default prices per seat category (paise)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/theaters/{{theaterId}}/prices
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"prices": {"REGULAR": 30000, "PREMIUM": 36000, "RECLINER": 60000}}

### Current default prices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/theaters/{{theaterId}}/prices
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

### Theater with its screens
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/theaters/{{theaterId}}
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

### Update the theater
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/theaters/{{theaterId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"name": "PVR Forum Mall", "area": "Koramangala", "address": "Hosur Road"}

### Deactivate the screen
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/screens/{{screenId}}/deactivate
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

### Deactivate the theater
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/theaters/{{theaterId}}/deactivate
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN
